  "text": "proprium.d-n-iesu-christi-regis-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Christ the King” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Almighty and eternal God, Who willed to restore all things in Your beloved Son, the King of the Universe, graciously grant that all the families of nations, torn asunder by the wound of sin, may submit to His most gentle rule, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
